// concatenating the underlying ast.SelectionSets, deliberately: gqlgen caches
// CollectFields results under a key derived from the *address and length* of
// the selection set passed in, and a slice synthesized here would not be
// retained by that cache — so a later allocation of the same length could land
// on the recycled address and take a stale hit. Collecting each alias's own
// (gqlgen-owned) selections and appending the results keeps every cache key on
// memory gqlgen itself holds.
